WEBVTT

00:09:29.398 --> 00:09:30.524
and gender equality.

00:09:30.858 --> 00:09:34.069
Canada -- feminist government,
gender-balanced cabinet --

00:09:34.111 --> 00:09:35.863
and they are doing gender budgeting,

00:09:35.863 --> 00:09:40.117
but they are taking into account
the needs of Indigenous groups of people.

00:09:40.117 --> 00:09:42.494
So this is also something
that we want to do

00:09:42.494 --> 00:09:43.704
and we have to do.

00:09:44.038 --> 00:09:46.373
Let me take you to Morocco.

00:09:46.373 --> 00:09:49.793
Morocco is working with gender
budgeting for 20 years.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.338
Indonesia, with the help
of the World Bank,

00:09:52.338 --> 00:09:55.633
has just analyzed
their whole budget system

00:09:55.674 --> 00:09:57.343
to make it more gender-responsive.

00:09:57.343 --> 00:09:59.261
And I need to take you again to Bosnia,

00:09:59.261 --> 00:10:01.722
because I did start with that example.